{"product_id":"some-tests","title":"Some Tests","description":"\u003cp\u003e• The unnerving new novel from the acclaimed author of Demons and The Cook • Some Tests is about waking up one morning and finding your ordinary life changed forever  • This remarkable novel of ideas brilliantly skewers the current state of western medicine, our disconnected approach to death, and in true Macauley style provides an appealingly strange alternative for the dying • Wayne Macauley is one of Australia's most original and admired writers and Some Tests will only enhance his reputation  • Demons was shortlisted for the Victorian Premier’s Literary Award; The Cook won the 2012 Most Underrated Book Award, and was shortlisted for the Victorian and West Australian Premier's Literary Awards and the Melbourne Prize  • A great novel for bookclub discussions • Author will be a guest of major literary festivals in 2017  • Author lives in Brunswick, Melbourne\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 153 x 232\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Wayne Macauley\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781925355932\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 272\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45750690513049,"sku":"16RC-29781925355932","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d6b413ae722_Some_Tests_Wayne_Macauley.jpg?v=1758970685","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/some-tests","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}